SenseVoiceSmall model (optional reaction features)
==================================================

The optional reaction-feature pass in the live/VOD clipper
(backend/src/live/sensevoice_scan.py, off by default) uses the
SenseVoiceSmall model by Alibaba Group / FunAudioLLM. The model weights
are distributed under the FunASR Model Open Source License Agreement
v1.1; the full licence text ships with this product at
docs/registries/FunASR_MODEL_LICENSE_v1.1.txt, and the model name
"SenseVoiceSmall" is retained as that licence requires. The weights are
not part of this repository: the official weights are downloaded,
pinned by SHA-256, by tools/live/fetch_sensevoice.py. The FunASR
toolkit used for inference is MIT-licensed.

The "shout" signal in the same pass is adapted from NeonClipping
(https://github.com/iamajmeena/neonclipping), MIT-licensed, copyright
its respective contributors.
